WEBVTT

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:02.920
PriPara-ding-dong!

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:04.520
Good afternoon, everyone.

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:08.360
We have an important announcement.
All idols, please gather in the Fountain Square.

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:09.400
What's this?

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.110
What's going on?

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:11.840
Is it some new event?

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:13.360
An important announcement?

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:18.050
A bird?

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:19.040
No, it's a plane!

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:22.600
Bonjour!

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.130
It's Paris-nii from PriParis!

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:29.730
It's PriParis's Meganii!

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:31.370
Here in the flesh!

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:32.840
My life has meaning now!

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:37.050
Ça va, Parajuku mesdemoiselles?

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:38.560
This elegant!

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:39.560
Tough!

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:40.770
Monsieur!

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:47.460
... has travelled all the way from the PriPara capital, PriParis, to your lovely town of Parajuku.

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:48.360
Mes amours.

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:50.250
Paris-nii-san!

00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:52.650
What brings Paris-nii here today...

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:57.490
I have an important announcement
for all assembled mesdemoiselles.

00:00:58.510 --> 00:01:00.170
An important announcement?

00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:01.720
What could it be?

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:04.260
Parajuku's PriPara will this year...

00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:05.450
This year...

00:01:05.450 --> 00:01:06.040
Hologra–

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:07.420
Hologrammation!

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:11.200
This year welcomes its 222nd year!

00:01:11.310 --> 00:01:12.440
Wow!

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:13.880
I had no idea it was that old!

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:17.950
222 years?

00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:20.640
You're a couple of hundred million years off there, Onee-chan.

00:01:20.920 --> 00:01:26.440
And to commemorate this 222nd anniversary, we are extending a chance to create a new brand.

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:28.430
A new brand?

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:32.450
Truly a once-in-a-lifetime chance!

00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:34.940
I hope you all enjoy this special occasion!

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:39.540
That being said, compared to the 2222-year-old history of the gold standard, PriParis,

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:41.570
this town's PriPara is but a fledgling.

00:01:43.480 --> 00:01:48.040
You certainly do like referring to your precious PriParis as a standard.

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:52.550
Well, it is the very centre of the PriPara world, after all.

00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:58.210
It's home to the Loupre, where the world's oldest snapped PriTicket

00:01:58.210 --> 00:02:01.970
is preserved as a priceless historical relic.

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:04.420
And so, ça va bien...

00:02:04.420 --> 00:02:08.540
We are searching for the design for a new brand!

00:02:08.540 --> 00:02:14.660
The design selected after our careful curation will be sold in Prism Stone shops all around the world.

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:16.130
I'm going to enter!

00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:24.170
Capisce!

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:26.370
I'm Manaka Lala!

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:28.120
I'm in my sixth year of primary school!

00:02:28.470 --> 00:02:32.380
Keep winning through the Divine Idol Grand Prix and become a Divine Idol!

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:34.920
All the other idols are amazing, but I won't give up!

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:36.920
Cheer me on, everyone!

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:16.780
I think this coord is good,

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:23.020
but I'm gonna design a coord that'll ensnare everyone with your bewitching cuteness one day!

00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:27.710
That's why I'll become a designer – no, a deviller!

00:04:27.710 --> 00:04:30.480
That makes me sho happy! It's a promish!

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:31.770
A binding vow!

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:33.260
If you break this promish...

00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:35.300
You have to go to Heaven-geru!

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:36.850
It shall be to Hell-devi!

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:41.710
A brand that to show Mikan off to the whole world!

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:42.760
But...

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:47.850
This'll be a piece of cake. I can easily knock out one or two hundred new designs.

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:48.900
Dorothy!

00:04:48.900 --> 00:04:51.520
No mountain too high! I shall enter as well!

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:52.840
Pushu!

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:54.890
I'll give it a try, too.

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:56.530
Me too, me too!

00:04:56.530 --> 00:04:58.610
Pri-eave matters of fashion to me.

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:00.820
That is...

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:04.240
The mother of the goddess, Lala. And so...

00:05:05.140 --> 00:05:06.250
The Goddess Jewlie.

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:14.010
The selection process will handled by l'artiste –
no, <i>les artistes</i> extraordinaires of Parajuku!

00:05:14.820 --> 00:05:16.350
Da Vinci!
Cosmic!

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:19.900
Blow Millet away with its uniqueness-Da Vinci!
Show us some out-of-this-galaxy designs!

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:20.200
A good design...

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:20.760
You see...

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:23.210
That will be all for now! Thank you both very much!

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:25.300
Aroma, you should go for it!

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:29.560
You're always drawing amazing
coord designs! I've seen them!

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:30.260
Devi?!

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:31.520
But...

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:35.290
Fiend! It hurts when you bite me!

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:37.020
Go for it, Aroma!

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:37.980
Fight-garu!

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:40.940
This is a wonderful chance for my dear little devil-nekon.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:43.900
The deadline is noon in one week's time.

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:45.810
Why noon, you ask?

00:05:45.810 --> 00:05:47.870
It is the PriParis standard.

00:05:47.870 --> 00:05:49.370
Your "standard" again.

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:54.050
PriParis's grand opening was noon 2222 years ago, after all.

00:05:55.530 --> 00:05:59.250
My hopes are high, mesdemoiselles!

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:00.930
Okay!

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:06.320
What? You're not gonna enter, Aroma?

00:06:06.320 --> 00:06:07.260
Garu?

00:06:07.620 --> 00:06:10.540
How come? You were good at drawing, if I pri-call.

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:13.080
I'd love to see what you come up with.

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:14.470
You don't want to?

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:17.140
Th–that's untrue!

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:19.170
It's an unholy untruth...

00:06:20.210 --> 00:06:23.440
Those judges would deem-on my work poor out of ignorance!

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:24.210
Cosmic!

00:06:24.210 --> 00:06:25.650
Da Vinci!

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:28.560
That sounds like an excuse to me.

00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:30.110
As though you lack confidence.

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:31.410
Ulp!

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:34.280
There's a limit to the demon-transigence I'll accept!

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:36.080
Then what problem is there?

00:06:37.060 --> 00:06:39.790
You should take on the challenge fair and square.

00:06:41.470 --> 00:06:45.630
Not that it matters, since <i>I'm</i> the one they're gonna pick.

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:47.540
You're the <i>last</i> person they'd choose-pri.

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:48.350
Inconceivable.

00:06:48.350 --> 00:06:49.650
<i>Excuse</i> me?

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:52.350
I want to you keep your promise with me.

00:06:52.350 --> 00:06:56.930
You promised to design an outfit that made
me look the cutest in the whole world!

00:06:58.060 --> 00:06:59.970
You've gotta keep promises-garu!

00:06:59.970 --> 00:07:02.060
Oh, god, the pain!

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:04.820
All right, all right!

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:12.490
Stand and behold! My black magic shall have all the world's PriParas consumed in the flames of Hell!

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:18.490
Geru!

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:19.360
Garu!

00:07:20.430 --> 00:07:22.300
A devilish design...

00:07:22.300 --> 00:07:24.000
A new brand...

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:28.460
This won't do!

00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:32.680
What I need is inspiration!

00:07:34.930 --> 00:07:36.620
The unscalable wall.

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:37.720
Useless!

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:40.000
How's it look?

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:47.150
Pushu...

00:07:47.470 --> 00:07:49.610
Garu! Garu! Garu!
Geru! Geru! Geru!

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:52.040
Tomorrow's finally the deadline!

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:54.900
I'm happy you two are staying over-garu!

00:07:54.900 --> 00:07:56.780
That's right, stamp it nicely-nekon.

00:07:56.780 --> 00:08:01.040
That's the way to make the chewiest and tastiest curry udon.

00:08:01.070 --> 00:08:02.270
We're making a midnight snack!

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:03.720
Stamp it more!

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:04.990
Garu!

00:08:04.990 --> 00:08:07.500
More! More! More!

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:09.260
Silence thy din!

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:14.600
Be as silent as the grave!
Disturb me not during my infernal endeavours!

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:18.450
I just wanted to cheer on Aroma...

00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:19.800
Garuru's all deflated-garu.

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:23.100
Don't worry! Udon may be out, but we can still make curry-nekon.

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:29.860
Cock-a-doodle-doo!

00:08:30.370 --> 00:08:35.820
Today is the deadline!
Ensure you're not late, my lovely idols!

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:40.800
The venue today is the 13th floor. Make sure you're there!

00:08:41.570 --> 00:08:44.000
I... I have finished, at last.

00:08:50.890 --> 00:08:52.140
Whoops.

00:08:56.750 --> 00:08:58.160
Have to hurry...

00:08:59.610 --> 00:09:02.310
I might not make it before the deadline...

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:02.390
ACCEPTING APPLICATIONS

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:02.980
A new brand from Parajuku...

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:04.480
I wonder if they'll pick mine...

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:04.620
ACCEPTING APPLICATIONS

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:06.580
I'm so excited!

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:08.190
It's almost time, huh?

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:10.540
I'm pri excited to see the new Mirei brand.

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:12.240
Huh? It's gonna be mine!

00:09:12.240 --> 00:09:13.490
Relax, everyone!

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:16.700
Aroma's gone already?!

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:18.250
I'm gonna chase her!

00:09:18.250 --> 00:09:19.370
Let's hurry-garu!

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:21.100
Ga–ru...

00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:21.700
Hm?

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:22.370
Nekon?
Geru?

00:09:23.220 --> 00:09:24.730
What's this-garu?

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:26.830
Hey, that's...

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:29.210
That's Aroma's entry!

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:31.630
Then what did Aroma take with her-nekon?

00:09:35.310 --> 00:09:37.930
We will finish taking entries momentarily.

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:40.300
Any outstanding entrants, please make haste!

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:44.330
Aroma! We're coming!

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:45.630
Garu!

00:09:47.080 --> 00:09:48.900
Mikan, you went past it-garu!

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:50.260
I can't stop running!

00:09:50.260 --> 00:09:51.650
Leave it to Garuru-garu!

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:53.690
Thank you, Garuru!

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:55.220
Garu!

00:10:03.340 --> 00:10:04.510
Garu...

00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:11.760
Garu! Garu! Garu!

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:14.840
I'd like... to enter...

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:18.410
It is noon!

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:20.350
Begin the curation, s'il-vous plaît.

00:10:20.350 --> 00:10:21.880
Da Vinci!
Cosmic!

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:24.520
Burn, my Cosmic!

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:27.480
Appear before me, my muse-Da Vinci!

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:37.730
What high-velocity curating!

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:38.850
Artists are so amazing!

00:10:39.180 --> 00:10:40.410
Hm?

00:10:48.010 --> 00:10:51.610
Garu... Garu... Garu...

00:10:53.480 --> 00:10:55.300
That's... mine.

00:10:57.720 --> 00:10:59.410
It looks tasty-Da Vinci!

00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:05.560
There we have it – the curation is complete!

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:10.600
Whose design will be chosen for Parajuku's new brand?

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:12.760
No cosmically successful entrants!

00:11:12.760 --> 00:11:14.650
No successful entrants-Da Vinci!

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:17.700
Too bad, huh, Jululu?

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:18.650
Pushu...

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:21.200
I guess making a new brand is beyond us-pri.

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:25.050
Hmph! Those judges couldn't comprehend my true skill.

00:11:25.050 --> 00:11:26.580
Dorothy, relax!

00:11:29.020 --> 00:11:34.510
Unfortunately, it appears there will be no new brand from the submissions today – pardonnez.

00:11:37.530 --> 00:11:38.960
It was hopeless after all.

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:44.240
Garuru...

00:11:44.240 --> 00:11:46.300
No... I didn't make it-garu...

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:05.070
Aroma...

00:12:05.070 --> 00:12:08.210
It was my folly, mistaking the pieces of paper.

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:10.860
I'm in a hell of my own making.

00:12:10.860 --> 00:12:14.080
Don't bottle it up;
you should go ahead and cry.

00:12:14.730 --> 00:12:16.510
Who's... crying?

00:12:17.260 --> 00:12:18.640
Nekon...

00:12:19.370 --> 00:12:21.380
We should leave her alone.

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:22.290
Nekon.
Garu.

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:38.180
So no new brand...

00:12:38.180 --> 00:12:39.860
What a shame.

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:41.260
There'll be another time.

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:57.310
You stayed by me in my torment?

00:12:58.250 --> 00:12:59.470
It warms my black heart.

00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:03.460
But looking at it now with a cool head,

00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:06.180
I don't know if it's my most transcendent creation.

00:13:06.960 --> 00:13:13.140
Even if I'd made the deadline, there's no way this design would have been chosen.

00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:16.280
And...

00:13:17.280 --> 00:13:20.250
There's not just the vow from when I was a child.

00:13:20.250 --> 00:13:23.140
Now we have a fanged apostle as our companion, too.

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:28.870
This is the meat bun Mikan sketched...
Cheer up Aroma
Garu!!

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:30.130
When you wake up
you can have this meat bun

00:13:30.130 --> 00:13:31.080
Garuru bit it... and there's Neko-nee's pawprint.

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:33.660
There's always
another chance
Nekon

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:33.940
Garuru bit it... and there's Neko-nee's pawprint.

00:13:33.940 --> 00:13:34.000
There's always
another chance
Nekon

00:13:38.760 --> 00:13:39.710
That's right...

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:43.210
Not just an angel...

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:45.590
But a coord that suits a fanged apostle!

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:50.560
I want to give radiance to those who support my infernal endeavours!

00:13:50.560 --> 00:13:52.380
A new power rises within me.

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:55.780
Awaken!

00:13:55.780 --> 00:13:56.410
Garu?

00:13:57.320 --> 00:13:59.690
Garumageddon's going to perform!

00:14:01.210 --> 00:14:02.320
Garu!

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:08.280
A performance with this coord!

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:13.490
We consider the curation consigned to the infernal realm.
We just want to perform wearing this coord.

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:14.270
Garu!
Yep!

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:15.970
Okay then!

00:14:22.480 --> 00:14:25.260
Scan the appropriate number of MyTickets for your coord.

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:27.850
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:14:27.850 --> 00:14:29.700
Starting the Coord Change.

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:37.890
Hearts for Mikan's meat buns, and diamonds for Garuru's fang-prints!

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:39.060
LoveDevi!

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:41.680
Geru!

00:14:42.700 --> 00:14:45.790
A brand cute, devilish and angelic,

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:50.290
suited to demon, cherub and fanged apostle alike! Its name:

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:51.580
LoveDevi!

00:14:51.580 --> 00:14:52.660
Devi!

00:14:53.800 --> 00:14:56.330
LoveDevi sallies forth on the celestial battlefield!

00:14:56.530 --> 00:14:57.700
I love Garumageddon!

00:14:57.700 --> 00:14:58.770
Go, Garumageddon!

00:14:58.770 --> 00:14:59.570
Aroma and...

00:14:59.570 --> 00:15:00.500
Mikan!

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:02.830
Angel and devil! And...

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:05.470
The fanged apostle, Garuru!

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:07.410
Garu!

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:09.560
It's so cute I gotta capisce!

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:11.180
So that's LoveDevi-pri?

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:12.760
It suits them so well!

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:15.010
I... guess it's cool enough.

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:18.050
Those who pass through the gates of PriPara!

00:15:18.050 --> 00:15:19.890
Cast aside all hope!

00:15:20.450 --> 00:15:24.140
No, I will take you to heaven!

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:26.730
It shall be to hell.

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:28.240
Aromageddon and...

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:29.080
Garuru!

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:31.080
Devil, angel and beast together!

00:15:31.690 --> 00:15:34.120
We are Garumageddon!

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:36.120
Garu!

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:56.050
Making Drama, switch on!

00:17:02.060 --> 00:17:03.010
Devi!

00:17:03.010 --> 00:17:04.500
Onward!

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:05.680
Garu!
Geru!

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:10.850
Devi!

00:17:11.780 --> 00:17:15.090
Mischievous Macaroon Factory!

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:19.320
Cyalume Change!

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:26.130
Geru!

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:07.840
Please curse me, Aroma-chan!

00:18:07.840 --> 00:18:09.080
Oh, wow, I love that coord!

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:10.890
I want to wear it!

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:12.880
Aroma, you're the greatest!

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:15.240
Aro! Momo!

00:18:16.300 --> 00:18:17.880
Thankies!

00:18:21.220 --> 00:18:23.930
Now, to the Divine Idol stage!

00:18:23.930 --> 00:18:27.240
Divine Idol Challenge, switch on!

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:33.410
Divine Jewel, Cyalume Jewel Mic!

00:18:33.410 --> 00:18:37.280
Let the challenge commence...
to become a Divine Idol!

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:59.400
The closet's doors open for you...

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:02.130
Within is a coord fit for a Divine Idol!

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:21.020
Garu!

00:19:21.020 --> 00:19:24.460
Aroma! Mikan! That was amazing! Congratulations!

00:19:24.460 --> 00:19:25.700
Th–Thanks!

00:19:25.700 --> 00:19:26.970
But, you didn't...

00:19:28.090 --> 00:19:29.680
Don't worry-garu!

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:34.410
Garuru's gonna catch right up to you!
And get a Super Cyalume Coord!

00:19:34.410 --> 00:19:38.360
If I fail today, then tomorrow!
If I fail tomorrow, then the next day!

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:40.280
No matter what, there's always a tomorrow!

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:42.040
That's the earthbound spirit!

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:47.310
Garumageddon will pass through Hell itself if it needs to, and enter the Divine Idol Grand Prix!

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:49.950
We'll be waiting for you!

00:19:50.720 --> 00:19:54.000
Garumageddon is invincible!

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:59.120
LoveDevi is out of this galaxy!

00:19:59.120 --> 00:20:02.430
Aroma-chan's skill is something
to look forward to-tankhamun-Da Vinci!

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:04.730
Très bien.

00:20:04.730 --> 00:20:07.820
Don't you want to choose it as the new brand?

00:20:07.820 --> 00:20:09.150
Oui?

00:20:09.150 --> 00:20:12.490
Even the Goddess Jewlie has acknowledged its appeal.

00:20:12.490 --> 00:20:15.500
Isn't LoveDevi worthy of being a new brand?

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:19.810
It's a pity, isn't it? Perhaps if it had made the deadline...

00:20:19.810 --> 00:20:22.060
It's not noon <i>yet</i>.

00:20:22.060 --> 00:20:23.140
Pardonnez?

00:20:23.140 --> 00:20:24.700
What do you mean?

00:20:25.890 --> 00:20:28.210
It's nearly evening here in Parajuku...

00:20:28.210 --> 00:20:30.320
But there's a time difference, isn't there?

00:20:30.320 --> 00:20:32.120
It's still morning in PriParis.

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:34.640
Before the deadline.

00:20:34.640 --> 00:20:36.400
That's sophistry!

00:20:36.400 --> 00:20:38.560
"PriParis is the gold standard".

00:20:38.560 --> 00:20:43.740
After you've espoused its centrality so,
are you going to say just the deadline is based in Parajuku?

00:20:43.740 --> 00:20:45.180
Well... that's...

00:20:46.700 --> 00:20:48.670
I suppose you have me there.

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:51.340
What's this?

00:20:51.340 --> 00:20:52.210
What's going on?

00:20:52.210 --> 00:20:53.210
It's all dark...

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:54.930
Ta-da!

00:20:56.060 --> 00:20:57.630
What hath transpired?

00:20:57.630 --> 00:21:02.420
This is somewhat sudden, but we have an announcement to make!

00:21:03.880 --> 00:21:06.450
Aroma's LoveDevi has been recognised

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:09.790
and will be made into a new brand!

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:12.730
Hoo-Raphael!

00:21:12.730 --> 00:21:15.860
Félicitations! Mademoiselle Aroma, congratulations!

00:21:16.050 --> 00:21:18.110
Aroma! Way to go!

00:21:18.110 --> 00:21:19.750
We love you, Aroma!

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:30.470
If you so insist, I shan't not not not let you make LoveDevi into a new brand!

00:21:30.470 --> 00:21:32.970
Honestly, kid won't come out and say she's happy.

00:21:32.970 --> 00:21:34.180
Congratulations!

00:21:34.510 --> 00:21:36.110
Roma!

00:21:36.700 --> 00:21:41.490
I can't believe my dear little devil has grown so much-nekon...

00:21:42.020 --> 00:21:48.140
From this moment forward, the brand LoveDevi can be worn at Prism Stone shops worldwide!

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:49.860
LoveDevi's pretty darn swell!

00:21:50.400 --> 00:21:51.910
Ah can't get enough!

00:21:52.280 --> 00:21:54.340
LoveDevi's très bien!

00:21:55.520 --> 00:22:01.060
A hand for the hardworking Mademoiselle Aroma, whose accomplishment will be written in PriPara history!

00:22:01.180 --> 00:22:02.680
Congratulations, Aroma!

00:22:02.680 --> 00:22:06.800
Blessings upon her as she departs for the brave new world of a designer!

00:22:08.420 --> 00:22:09.650
Darkness!

00:22:09.650 --> 00:22:12.270
My first step into the demon realm as a deviller!

00:22:12.930 --> 00:22:16.580
There's nothing black magic can't achievil!

00:22:16.580 --> 00:22:18.850
This is the birth of LoveDevi!

00:23:51.890 --> 00:23:56.240
Garuru's going to become a team with you two!
Let's do the team formation ceremony!

00:23:56.240 --> 00:23:58.290
No, no, you can't!

00:23:58.290 --> 00:24:02.170
A Vocal Doll can't snap a PriTicket – something terrible will occur!

00:24:02.170 --> 00:24:05.070
Garuru's made up her mind! Garuru's snapping!

00:24:05.070 --> 00:24:07.940
We'll become a real team and become Divine Idols!

00:24:07.940 --> 00:24:10.090
I won't let you!

00:24:10.090 --> 00:24:12.050
I'll stop you, just you watch!

00:24:12.670 --> 00:24:16.360
Next time, <i>Wake Up, Garuru!</i>

00:24:16.360 --> 00:24:19.720
Aim to be a Divine Idol! Let's go, PriPara!
